---
import Layout from '../components/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Shipping Policy | Peniel Hardwares">
  <div class="policy-container">
    <h1>Shipping Policy</h1>
    <p class="last-updated">Last Updated: May 12, 2026</p>

    <section>
      <h2>1. Shipping Overview</h2>
      <p>We offer shipping and delivery services for all products listed on our website. Our goal is to ensure your hardware and materials reach you safely and on time.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>2. Delivery Areas</h2>
      <p>We currently provide delivery services within <strong>Nagercoil and surrounding areas in Kanyakumari district</strong>. For orders outside this region, please contact us specifically to arrange long-distance transport.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>3. Shipping Costs</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Store Pickup:</strong> Free (Pick up from our Ramanputhoor Junction store).</li>
        <li><strong>Local Delivery (within 10km):</strong> Flat rate of ₹100 or Free for orders above ₹5,000.</li>
        <li><strong>Standard Shipping:</strong> Calculated at checkout based on weight and distance.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>4. Processing Time</h2>
      <p>Orders are typically processed within <strong>24 to 48 hours</strong>. You will receive an update once your order is ready for pickup or has been dispatched for delivery.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>5. Delivery Estimates</h2>
      <p>Local deliveries are usually completed within 1-2 business days. For standard shipping, the estimated time is 3-7 business days depending on the location.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>6. Damaged Goods</h2>
      <p>If you receive a damaged item, please report it to us within 24 hours of delivery. We will arrange for a replacement or refund as per our Return Policy.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>7. Contact Information</h2>
      <p>For tracking your order or shipping inquiries, please reach out:</p>
      <div class="contact-box">
        <p><strong>Email:</strong> penielhardwares@gmail.com</p>
        <p><strong>Phone:</strong> +91 94886 14888</p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .policy-container {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 4rem 1.5rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .policy-container h1 {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    color: var(--accent-gold);
  }
  .last-updated {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }
  section {
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }
  h2 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  p {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }
  ul {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }
  li {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  .contact-box {
    background: var(--glass-bg);
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 1rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }
</style>
